abstract: >-
  Reproducible scripts, protocols, aggregate results, and text-free item-level
  predictions for auditing duplicate, source, temporal, calibration, tuning,
  and cross-corpus effects in TF-IDF classifiers trained on ISOT and evaluated
  on FakeNewsNet–PolitiFact and GossipCop. Version 1.0.0 adds title-level
  near-duplicate auditing, title-specific group-fold SVM sensitivity,
  source-clustered bootstrap intervals, seen/unseen-hostname summaries, and
  external-cleaning sensitivity analyses.
keywords:
  - fake news detection
  - external validation
  - dataset shift
  - construct validity
  - reproducibility
  - TF-IDF
